OL,3,ACatherine Zeta-Jones bases new role on
OL,4,Afunny Welsh people she knows
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Catherine Zeta-Jones says she
OL,7,Fbased her performance in the new series
OL,8,FKill Jackie on people she knows in
OL,9,FWales.
OL,11,FThe Mumbles star plays Jackie Price, a
OL,12,Fformer cocaine dealer who is being
OL,13,Ftargeted by hitmen, in a new series for
OL,14,FPrime.
OL,16,FIt is the first time she has played a
OL,17,Frole using her Swansea accent and the
OL,18,Ffirst time she has filmed a drama in
OL,19,FWales.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
