OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACatherine Zeta-Jones bases new role on
OL,4,Afunny Welsh people she knows
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I played on people I know in Wales,
OL,7,Fpeople who are comedic and the accent
OL,8,Fmakes it funny and real and true, but
OL,9,Fthe character comes from a tough side
OL,10,Fof Swansea, which we do have as well,"
OL,11,Fshe said.
